            "heading": "How does it work?",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most night creams only sit on top of dry skin. Noula uses Red Rice Recovery Complex™ to comfort skin through the night, when your moisture barrier is most ready for support.</p><p>Inspired by Korean beauty rituals, red rice extract pairs with ceramides, hyaluronic acid and Vitamin B5 to help dry, dull skin feel cushioned, hydrated and calm by morning.</p><p>No greasy residue. No harsh overnight peel. Just soft, replenished skin that looks like it got the rest you did.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
